# Wave W17-AC (Route 227): stark pine — an ash-dusted pine: grey-green tiers carrying a settled dusting of pale ash on the crown, its highlight the ash itself, lifted clear of the turf, on stark turf (ground baked in). Route 227’s own tree — split from Route 225’s zone pine by the dusting entire (ash-settled grey-green vs tough bare sparse) and from Route 216’s snow pines by burden: this crown carries ash, theirs carry snow.
